  {proyect?.tecnologies.map((tecnology) => (
    <BreadCrumb icon={tecnology} class="w-6 h-6" />
  ))}
</div>
```

**Astro Layout for Transitions:** `/tmp/repo/src/layouts/Layout.astro`
```astro
