### **3. TECH SKILL BADGES COLOR SYSTEM**

**Color Data Structure:** `/tmp/repo/tecnologies.json`
```json
{
  "technologies": [
    {
      "name": "React",
      "icon": "IconReact",
      "color": "#61DAFB",
      "categorie": "frontend",
      "description": "UIs reactivas...",
      "tags": ["Hooks", "Context", "RSC"]
    },
    {
      "name": "Node",
      "icon": "IconNode",
      "color": "#339933",
      "categorie": "backend",
      ...
    }
    // 12+ technologies with specific hex colors
  ]
}
```

**Color Utility Functions:** `/tmp/repo/src/lib/color.ts`
```typescript
export function hexToRgb(hex: string) {
  if (!hex) return { r: 255, g: 255, b: 255 };
  const clean = hex.replace("#", "");
  const full = clean.length === 3
    ? clean.split("").map((c) => c + c).join("")
    : clean;
  const int = parseInt(full, 16);
  return {
    r: (int >> 16) & 255,
    g: (int >> 8) & 255,
    b: int & 255,
  };
}

export function hexToRgba(hex: string, alpha = 0.18) {
  const { r, g, b } = hexToRgb(hex);
  return `rgba(${r}, ${g}, ${b}, ${alpha})`;
}

export function hexToShadow(hex: string, alpha = 0.18) {
  return hexToRgba(hex, alpha);
}

export function hexToBorder(hex: string, alpha = 0.1) {
  return hexToRgba(hex, alpha);
}
```

**Badge Component with Dynamic Colors:** `/tmp/repo/src/components/BreadCrumb.astro`
```astro
---
import icons from "./icons";
import techData from "../../tecnologies.json";
import { hexToRgba, hexToShadow, hexToBorder } from "../lib/color";

const nameIcon = Astro.props.icon;
const found = techData.technologies.find((i) => i.name === nameIcon);
const Icon = found ? icons[found.icon] : icons.IconDefault;
const baseColor = found?.color ?? "#ffffff";

const bgRgba = hexToRgba(baseColor, 0.18);      // 18% opacity background
const shadowRgba = hexToShadow(baseColor, 0.18); // 18% opacity shadow
const borderRgba = hexToBorder(baseColor, 0.1);  // 10% opacity border
---

<article
  class="bc hover:scale-110 hover:animate-rotational-wave hover:bg-Sprimary-500/90 
  transition-all duration-300 ease-out dark:text-porcelain text-carbon"
  style={`--bc-bg: ${bgRgba}; --bc-shadow: ${shadowRgba}; --bc-border: ${borderRgba}`}
>
  <div class="bc__icon">
    <Icon />
  </div>
  <h3 class="bc__label">{found?.name ?? nameIcon}</h3>
</article>

<style>
  .bc {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    padding: 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background-color: var(--bc-bg);      /* Dynamic color with 18% opacity */
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px var(--bc-shadow);
    border: 1px solid var(--bc-border);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .bc:hover {
    transform: scale(1.05);
    background-color: #fb3758;  /* Primary pink */
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px var(--bc-shadow);
  }
</style>
```

**How It Works:**
1. Each technology has a hex color defined in `tecnologies.json`
2. `hexToRgba()` converts hex to RGBA with variable opacity
3. CSS custom properties (`--bc-bg`, `--bc-shadow`, `--bc-border`) receive computed RGB values
4. Each badge gets its own color-coded background, shadow, and border
5. On hover, animates to a scale of 1.05 and optionally runs rotational-wave animation

**Example Colors:**
- React: `#61DAFB` (cyan)
- Node: `#339933` (green)
- Html: `#E34F26` (orange)
- Docker: `#2496ED` (blue)

---

### **4. SKILLS SECTION GRID WITH HOVER EXPANSION**

The skills grid is a **interactive 6-column CSS Grid** that expands cards on hover.

**Component:** `/tmp/repo/src/components/SectionSkills.astro`

```astro
<section {...Astro.props} class="relative z-40">
  <h2 class="text-carbon dark:text-porcelain text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-16">
    Habilidades
  </h2>
  <div class="skills-grid grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-6 md:grid-rows-4 grid-flow-dense gap-4 h-[900px]">
    <Skill icon="Html" />
    <Skill icon="Css" />
    <Skill icon="Javascript" />
    <Skill icon="React" />
    <Skill icon="Node" />
    <Skill icon="Express" />
    <!-- 8 more skills -->
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const TOTAL_COLS = 6;
  const grid = document.querySelector(".skills-grid")!;
  const cards = grid.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-skill]");

  function activate(card: HTMLElement) {
    const colStart = getColStart(card);

    if (colStart + 1 > TOTAL_COLS) {
      card.style.gridColumnStart = String(TOTAL_COLS - 1);
    }

    grid.classList.remove("grid-flow-dense");  // Freeze grid layout

    cards.forEach((c) => {
      if (c !== card) {
        c.classList.add("opacity-20", "scale-95");
      }
    });

    card.classList.add("!col-span-2", "!row-span-2", "is-active");
  }

  function deactivate() {
    cards.forEach((c) => {
      c.style.gridColumnStart = "";
      c.classList.remove("opacity-20", "scale-95", "!col-span-2", "!row-span-2", "is-active");
    });
    grid.classList.add("grid-flow-dense");  // Restore dense packing
  }

  grid.addEventListener("mouseover", (e) => {
    const card = (e.target as HTMLElement).closest<HTMLElement>("[data-skill]");
    if (!card || grid.querySelector(".is-active") === card) return;
    deactivate();
    activate(card);
  });

  grid.addEventListener("mouseleave", () => {
    deactivate();
  });
</script>
```

**Skill Card Component:** `/tmp/repo/src/components/Skill.astro`

```astro
<article
  data-skill
  class={`skill-card group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl p-4 md:p-10
